=====TITLE=====
Backrooms

=====DESCRIPTION=====
This mod will create procedurally generated Backrooms in your 7 Days to Die world.

=====INSTALLATION=====
1.) Download the Mod.zip and LocalPrefabs.zip files
2.) Unzip the Mod.zip file and put the extracted folder in place of your Mods folder (typically located at C:\Program Files (x86)\Steam\steamapps\common\7 Days To Die\Mods)
3.) Unzip the LocalPrefabs.zip file and put the extracted folder in place of your LocalPrefabs folder (typically located at C:\Users\[YourUsername]\AppData\Roaming\7DaysToDie\LocalPrefabs).
4.) Unzip the BackroomsWorld.zip file and put the extracted folder into your GeneratedWorlds folder (typically located at C:\Users\[YourUsername]\AppData\Roaming\7DaysToDie\GeneratedWorlds).

=====HOW TO USE=====
1.) Run the game
2.) In the main menu, run the command "genBackrooms". This may take a few moments.
3.) Create a new world and be sure to set the Game World to "Backrooms World".
4.) That is all, enjoy :)

=====IMPORTANT NOTES=====
Horde Night currently does not work as there are no blocks for them to spawn on.

=====CREDITS=====
Just-Mir-Sir on Git and some variation of Mr. Sir elsewhere

